# WheelConnect's maps run on the free OpenStreetMap + Leaflet stack, so no API key or
# billing account is required for map display, markers, or geocoding to work.
#
# If you'd like higher-accuracy geocoding, set GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY as a *backend*
# environment variable (service-center-service) - see backend/service-center-service's
# application.properties. There is no frontend Google Maps key to configure.
